WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:04.967
Bot flew the big spaceship.

2
00:00:04.968 --> 00:00:09.483
Spark looked out the window.

3
00:00:09.484 --> 00:00:15.155
"A comet!" he said. "Let's chase it!"

4
00:00:15.156 --> 00:00:19.711
"We can't chase it," Ringo said.

5
00:00:19.712 --> 00:00:22.730
Spark saw a steering wheel.

6
00:00:22.731 --> 00:00:24.931
"It's my turn to steer!"

7
00:00:24.932 --> 00:00:26.851
He grabbed the wheel.

8
00:00:26.852 --> 00:00:29.863
The spaceship made a sharp turn!

9
00:00:29.864 --> 00:00:36.687
"Whoa!" Ringo cried. "That's not safe, Spark!

10
00:00:36.688 --> 00:00:39.552
Just look out the window."

11
00:00:39.553 --> 00:00:47.806
Spark groaned. "I already did that!

12
00:00:47.807 --> 00:00:50.205
What does this button do?"

13
00:00:50.206 --> 00:00:53.551
He pressed it.

14
00:00:53.552 --> 00:00:57.859
Everyone started to float.

15
00:00:57.860 --> 00:01:01.740
Bonk! Bot banged into the ceiling.

16
00:01:01.741 --> 00:01:08.955
"Spark!" Ringo cried. "You turned off the gravity!"

17
00:01:08.956 --> 00:01:12.652
"Whee!" Spark said.

18
00:01:12.653 --> 00:01:19.885
Ringo moaned. "I'm getting space sick!"

19
00:01:19.886 --> 00:01:23.114
Bot turned the gravity back on.

20
00:01:23.115 --> 00:01:28.584
Everyone fell to the floor.

21
00:01:28.585 --> 00:01:31.869
"Can we do that again?" Spark asked.

22
00:01:31.870 --> 00:01:47.303
"No!" Ringo said.

23
00:01:47.304 --> 00:01:59.857
The spaceship flew down to Sandy Moon.

24
00:01:59.858 --> 00:02:07.523
Suddenly big creatures jumped.

25
00:02:07.524 --> 00:02:11.920
"Whoa! What are those?" Ringo asked.

26
00:02:11.921 --> 00:02:14.603
"Moon bunnies," Bot said.

27
00:02:14.604 --> 00:02:17.021
"They're not very friendly.

28
00:02:17.022 --> 00:02:28.054
Sometimes they are even dangerous."

29
00:02:28.055 --> 00:02:34.643
The spaceship landed inside the base.

30
00:02:34.644 --> 00:02:43.075
A worker hurried over.

31
00:02:43.076 --> 00:02:45.802
"I'm Lou," the worker said.

32
00:02:45.803 --> 00:02:48.358
"Did you bring a new rover?

33
00:02:48.359 --> 00:02:50.071
Bud is stuck in moon sand.

34
00:02:50.072 --> 00:02:53.850
He's sinking!"

